NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000325 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000326 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000327 "=head1 DIAGNOSTICS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000328 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000329 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000330 "=head1 BUGS AND LIMITATIONS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000331 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000332 "Please report any bugs or feature requests to"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000333 "L<https://github.com/daoswald/List-BinarySearch-XS/issues>.  I will be "
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000334 "notified, and then you'll automatically be notified of progress on your bug as"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000335 "I make changes."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000336 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000337 "L<List::BinarySearch::XS> does not provide the C<binsearch_range> function that"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000338 "appears in L<List::BinarySearch>.  However, L<List::BinarySearch> is used, and"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000339 "this XS module is installed, that function will be available.  See the POD for"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000340 "L<List::BinarySearch> for details."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000341 ""
